<view class="admin-page admin-secondary-page admin-after-sale-page">
  <view class="admin-header">
    <view class="admin-title">{{ title }}</view>
    <view class="admin-subtitle">
      审核用户售后申请并触发模拟退款流程；不产生真实微信退款。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-status-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">状态信息</view>
    <view class="admin-section-note">
      售后审核、退款状态和订单回冲均以后端处理结果为准，页面只展示和提交审核意见。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-filter-card">
    <view class="admin-filter-title">筛选区</view>
    <view class="admin-filter-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{ statusFilters }}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="admin-filter-pill {{ status === item.value ? 'admin-filter-pill--active' : '' }}"
        data-status="{{ item.value }}"
        bindtap="onStatusFilterTap"
      >
        {{ item.label }}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <loading-view wx:if="{{ loading }}" text="正在加载售后"></loading-view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ errorText }}" class="admin-section-card admin-error-card">
    {{ errorText }}
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{ afterSales.length }}">
    <view
      wx:for="{{ afterSales }}"
      wx:key="_id"
      class="admin-section-card admin-list-card after-sale-card"
      data-id="{{ item._id }}"
      bindtap="goDetail"
    >
      <view class="admin-list-card-head">
        <view>
          <view class="admin-card-title">{{ item.after_sale_no }}</view>
          <view class="admin-card-subtitle">订单：{{ item.order_no }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-status-pill admin-status-pill--warning">
          {{ item.statusText }}
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">基础信息</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ item.reason || '未填写原因' }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">状态信息</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ item.amountText }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">操作记录</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">点击查看审核详情</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <empty-state
    wx:else
    title="暂无售后申请"
    description="用户提交后会显示在这里"
  ></empty-state>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-action-card admin-boundary-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">管理操作</view>
    <view class="admin-section-note">
      高风险售后处理需进入详情页人工确认；本页不直接判定退款成功。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
